WEBVTT

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:11.440
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:17.110
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.920
Well, I see you've actually come.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.770
I commend you for your bravery.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:32.430
But you've made a poor choice bringing those boys along with you.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.640
We'll make you eat those words!

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.160
You're in for a big surprise if you think we're the same as before!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.760
We'll beat you guys to a pulp!

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.800
Oh dear...

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.180
Don't screw with me!

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.420
I'll crush you all with one blow!

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.310
Once this ends, you'll never play soccer again!

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.230
We won't let you!

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.070
We'll protect soccer!

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:55.270
It's a really tense atmosphere in here.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.230
Yeah.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:58.010
What's that?

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:10.060
It's Nobunaga!

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:12.900
He came to see our match.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.450
There's one for motivation!

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:19.920
Show me your specialty in this so-called kemari battle.

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:22.590
Nobunaga-sama!

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:25.100
Upon my word, I will lead you to victory!

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:27.540
I look forward to it.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.110
Yes, sir!

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:39.570
That's...!

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:43.160
Imagawa Yoshimoto!

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:45.720
That's Imagawa Yoshimoto?

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:48.040
He looks more like a noble than a samurai.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:53.090
I look forward to seeing it...

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:59.590
The sight of my Imagawa's Army making a splendid victory as Lord Nobunaga bows before me in shame, that is.

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:04.770
We're fighting under the name of Oda's Army.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:06.320
Yeah.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:08.440
We need to focus ourselves.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.840
Honey!

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.500
How is the okonomiyaki coming along?

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.450
Almost done!

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.810
Honey, yakisoba al-

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:56.550
Huh?

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:59.500
And he's gone again!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.010
A festival?

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:12.770
Now, this match is being brought to you at the Cherry Blossom Plaza Stadium in Nagoya castle!

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:20.230
The match between Oda and Imagawa will begin soon with a kickoff!

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.910
I feel nervous.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:23.450
Yeah...

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:25.280
It'll be fine!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.950
Gorouta! Jingo!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.120
Yeah! We've practiced tons!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.590
Shishimaru is right!

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:32.700
Let's be confident!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.210
Right...

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:36.830
We'll win no matter what!

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.340
Yeah!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:47.590
You're in rather high spirits, but you're about to learn that this isn't a little kiddy's game.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.490
You won't pass!

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:04.860
Fei!

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:06.070
Tsurugi!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:10.320
Whoa! Tsurugi and Fei quickly get past Einam with wonderful teamwork!

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.290
No further!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.710
Defense Command 06!

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.010
<Magnet Draw>

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:23.300
What?

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:24.550
Drim!

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:27.630
Make it in!

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:28.890
Yes, sir!

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.640
Now, Imagawa has begun their counter!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.590
Ichimasa, we're stopping him!

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:33.890
Okay!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:39.060
Tasuke! Ichimasa!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.410
Drim passes by them instantly!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:48.820
Quarth!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.540
What was that?

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:56.190
Jingo, Gorouta! We'll stop him together!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:57.480
Out of my way!

00:05:58.650 --> 00:05:59.750
Don't back down!

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.180
Good job keeping your stance there!

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.530
N-No way...

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:13.820
Einam!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.440
Shoot Command 06!

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.150
<Plasma Ball>

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.110
I won't let you!

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:31.620
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:39.620
Shinsuke!

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.000
That was nothing!

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.190
So this is a kemari battle.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:47.760
How interesting.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:51.240
Those boys call it "soccer."

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.970
Soccer, is it?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.840
Guys, are you okay?

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:57.920
Y-Yeah...

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.860
But what was that?

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.480
I thought we could handle this...

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:06.480
They're much more powerful than we are...

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.950
Tasuke, I'm scared...

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.910
You can't lose heart!

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.760
We practiced so much!

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.480
Let's keep doing our best, everyone!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.950
B-But...

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.140
Those guys...

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.280
What's wrong here? It was stolen from him so easily!

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:28.630
Why, you...!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.400
Nishiki steals it back!

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.090
That was a close one!

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.500
T-Thank you, Nishiki-san!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.030
Don't worry about it!

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:41.670
Out of my way!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.640
What's wrong, Jingo! Ichimasa!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.080
Don't be scared of them!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.650
Do the same thing you did during practice and you'll be fine!

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.760
B-But even so...

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:57.780
I won't let you!

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.040
Leader!

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:03.500
Move!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.210
Gorouta...

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.260
I'll make it in!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.550
Goddess of the Vacant Skies, Athena!

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:16.670
I won't let you use Avatar Armed!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:22.980
Sengoku War God Musashi!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.020
That's not enough to beat me!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.240
Shoot Command K02!

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:34.490
<Athena Assault>

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.120
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.370
Armed!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.800
Imagawa makes the first goal!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.640
Quite impressive.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.690
I give you my praise.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.690
We still have plenty of time!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.970
Think positive!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.890
Tenma is right!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.490
Let's do our best, everyone!

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.960
Whatever I do doesn't work!

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:32.070
It's no good...

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:36.770
I-I can't move...

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.050
I'm scared...

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.160
I'll stop them, no matter what!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.690
No way!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.400
It's tougher for them than I thought...

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:57.900
What's more, since Tasuke-kun and the others aren't moving, the others are using up more energy than usual covering for them.

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:03.700
The first half is over!

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:14.320
I'm sorry, I thought we could do better.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:16.370
All we're doing is tiring everyone out.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.390
We're pulling you down again.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:19.870
Don't worry about it!

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.720
We're fine.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:23.850
But...

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:31.390
How will you overcome this situation?

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.420
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.910
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.660
All right, here's the plan for the second half.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:50.750
Don't attack.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.210
What do you mean, don't attack?

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.330
Don't be such a knob, <i>Toushiro</i> !

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.550
Don't you understand what's going on right now?!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.910
Listen to me.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:04.600
This plan is meant to help us win, of course.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.420
Trust me.

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:08.310
We're going to make the other team give us an opening.

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:09.770
An opening?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.430
That's right.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:19.280
And for this plan to work, I need Tasuke, Shishimaru, Ichimasa, Jingo, and Gorouta.

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.550
But we...

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.550
I don't think I can do it...

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.370
Don't give up!

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.500
You guys haven't used the full extent of your power yet!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.930
You know that, don't you?

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:34.500
But...

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:38.620
If you give up now, you'll regret it for sure later!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.580
Regret...

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.090
Think back!

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.890
Remember all of that training you did!

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:47.560
You practiced so much!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.730
You need to believe in yourself! In what you can do!

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.260
You've worked the hardest you can.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:01.400
Things will work out somehow! They will!

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:03.990
Tenma...

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.770
Now there's a speech!

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:09.480
You said everything I wanted to say!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:16.540
Now, let me explain to you what I mean about not attacking.

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:20.800
The second half will begin momentarily!

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.560
Shishimaru, Tenma is right.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.410
I don't want any regrets!

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:28.910
Yeah, me neither!

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:32.380
Stop shaking... Stop shaking, legs!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:34.130
I'm not scared! I'm not scared!

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:35.890
It will be fine!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.020
Guys...

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:42.860
Let's go, troops.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:44.520
Reiza!

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:46.700
Imagawa moves in for their next point!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.490
Will Oda be able to rally against them?!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:51.600
Reiza gets past Nishiki!

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:54.700
I have to stop her!

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:00.940
That's it! Keep it up!

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:02.170
Drim!

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.930
Your moves are getting better!

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:11.410
Einam!

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:14.560
Almost had it! Just a little further!

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.030
You'll get it next time!

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:24.940
Quarth!

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.240
Tenma and the others believe in us.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.160
What's the point if we don't live up to that?!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.130
I'll stop them no matter what!

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:41.710
What?!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.290
I did it...

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:52.930
I did it, Tenma!

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:55.100
Nice clear, Tasuke!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.940
If Tasuke can do it, so can we!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:58.690
Yeah!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:13:59.100
Yes!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.070
Good! Keep it up, you guys!

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:07.040
They're happy just for getting one thing right. What simple-minded brats.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.780
We'll crush you flat, you'll see.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:11.570
Einam!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:13.930
You...!

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:20.900
They're getting better by the second...

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:22.460
Now's the time.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:23.660
Start the plan!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.420
Plan?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:32.240
Huh? What's this? They're pulling back from the other team!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.700
So you <i>are</i>  going with that plan.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.140
Not bad.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.520
Are they trying to aim for a pass cut?

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.310
What shallow thinking.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:43.710
Reiza!

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:44.400
Neira!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.250
Perfect chance.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.410
Imagawa has a golden opportunity!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.540
We'll stop them!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.330
Yeah!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:56.400
You're mine!

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:00.290
Shoot Command 08!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.450
<Love Arrow>

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:04.250
Let's go!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:05.960
Yeah!

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.460
One-Night Castle!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.720
What?!

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:15.390
Magnificent!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:16.850
All right!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:17.930
It worked!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.520
There's the result of your training!

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:21.900
Nishiki-san!

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:23.060
Leave it to me!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:23.690
Tsurugi!

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.820
Whoa! Here Oda makes a counter!

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:29.320
I'll make it in!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.920
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:39.750
Armed!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.950
Keeper Command 03!

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.510
<Boom Shout>

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:00.410
1-1!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.270
Oda catches up!

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:06.300
This is mortifying! Mortifying!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:09.640
You did it, you did it!!!

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.300
Now we're tied!!!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.040
The force of One-Night Castle is amazing!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:19.290
Tasuke, Shishimaru, and Gorouta in particular are the strongest at holding their ground.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:24.210
One-Night Castle needs that tough, unbending stance in order to work.

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:30.920
Nevertheless, what a great plan making the opponent let their guard down by not attacking!!!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:35.930
What's more, the opponent assumed that Tasuke and the others wouldn't be able to stop their attack.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.430
I expected to create an opening from there.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:44.200
And that plan wouldn't have been possible either without One-Night Castle.

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:45.250
Tasuke!

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.080
Shishimaru!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:46.890
Gorouta!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:47.630
Ichimasa!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:48.610
Jingo!

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:53.860
Without your courage to face the enemy and your strong desire to defend at all costs,

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:58.450
we wouldn't have been able to deceive the enemy and change the state of the battle!

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:00.910
Toukichirou-san...

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.450
This point was made because all five of you worked together!

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.980
Great job!

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:07.960
All of us...

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.590
It's the point we all made!

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:13.820
That's right! We couldn't have done it without the help of each and every one of you!

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:16.130
Tenma!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.970
Soccer sure is fun!

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:21.570
Yeah!

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:24.910
Now, the match resumes!

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:30.150
Amazing! Oda's movements have gotten a lot better!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.110
One-Night Castle!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.540
One-Night Castle!!!

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.280
Will they get their next point?!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:47.210
Don't stop moving! Keep attacking!

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:49.210
I don't know about that...

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:52.880
I'll complete Avatar Armed for sure...

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:54.860
Takuto-sama...

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.740
I'll do it this time!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.610
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:07.850
Shindou-senpai...

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:09.020
Armed!

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:18.860
Oh no! He's failed at Avatar Armed!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.830
I'm still missing something!

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:23.580
Something...

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:27.780
Takuto-sama...

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:30.830
I'll get it back!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:33.420
Orca!

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:40.590
<i>Unfortunately, Nobunaga-sama, you do not rule the country.</i>

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:44.220
What is the name of that boy?

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:45.430
Sir.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.810
He is called Shindou Takuto.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:50.310
I see.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:52.360
All right!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.070
Playtime is over!

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.580
Leave this to me!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.190
Yes, sir!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:58.650
Is she...?!

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:01.440
Ghost Mixi-max!

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.790
Go, troops!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:08.200
Flatten them to the ground!

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.000
Reiza!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:17.500
Drim!

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:20.780
Leader!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.960
They attack fiercely in succession!

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:25.680
We'll defend here, Shishimaru, Gorouta!

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:26.630
Okay!

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:33.440
One-Night Castle!

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.450
I'll wipe you out!

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:37.730
Come out!

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:40.780
Goddess of the Vacant Skies, Athena!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:43.200
Armed!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:57.040
Shoot Command 07!

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:58.910
<Double Shot>

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:07.200
I'll stop it!

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.850
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.150
Armed!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.420
Goal!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.590
Imagawa takes another point!

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:42.880
N-No way...

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:51.430
My Avatar Armed isn't strong enough...

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:59.190
The power of Avatar Armed is greatly influenced by its user's ability plus condition.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:20:59.840
Don't worry.

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:03.380
Keep training and it'll get stronger.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.380
Bravo, bravo.

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:12.660
As I thought, Oda is no enemy of mine.

00:22:54.010 --> 00:22:54.940
Nobunaga.

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:55.930
Toukichirou-san.

00:22:55.930 --> 00:22:56.730
Okatsu-san.

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:57.930
And Tasuke.

00:22:58.090 --> 00:23:01.980
When everyone's feelings join together, a new power comes out!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:03.730
Next, The Dream Of Rule.

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:05.520
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:19.480
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:23.510
We've practiced tons!

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:25.330
Let's be confident!

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:26.540
That's all!
